0..74 Comment "// The circle\'s loop space as a group, after the group-law half of cubical"
75..151 Comment "// Agda\'s `Cubical/HITs/S1/Base.agda`: spinning as a map of sums, winding as"
152..221 Comment "// one, and the loops commuting. `circle.gandr` holds the equivalence"
222..297 Comment "// `winding` these laws read through, `int-sum.gandr` the integers\' sum and"
298..373 Comment "// its laws, and `circle-rotation.gandr` the circle\'s multiplication. Where"
374..446 Comment "// cubical fills a cube by `hcomp`, a law here is conversion on words or"
447..460 Comment "// `Path.ap`."
461..463 Comment "//"
464..547 Comment "// Out of reach by design: `ΩS¹≡ℤ`, the loops equal to the integers as types,"
548..623 Comment "// needs univalence; `isSetΩS¹` and `toPropElim` need the h-level ladder;"
624..697 Comment "// `basedΩS¹ x ≡ ℤ` at every point needs equivalences as structure."
699..772 Comment "// The circle, the integers, winding, spinning and the round trip `sect`."
