2100..2177 Comment "/// Winding a composite is summing the windings (cubical\'s `winding-hom`), by"
2178..2252 Comment "/// induction on the first loop, written last so its match stands directly"
2253..2331 Comment "/// under the recursion, where the checkers read it as a fold, and summed with"
2332..2396 Comment "/// `wind(q)` first because the sum descends its second summand:"
2397..2477 Comment "/// `Path.here(wind(q))` on the empty word, and the recursive call carried along"
2478..2551 Comment "/// `up` or `down`. The composite in its type is read off the parameters\'"
2552..2611 Comment "/// written types (#423), and the kernel reads its endpoint"
2612..2671 Comment "/// `plus(wind(q), wind(p))` as the call it returns (#424)."
